{
    "about": [
        "Base price offered by one legacy purchase receipt line, as the legacy system logged it in mBarang_ChangePrice.UpPrice (the curHarga of Goods_receipt.php, (Harga_Beli + Harga_Beli x Rate_Pajak / 100) / Konversi, discount ignored), read-only on 16 November 2026 by legacy-receipt-base-prices.sql. Amounts and percents only.",
        "Every case is fed to receiptBasePrice with 4 decimals, the precision of the legacy money column. A case must give legacy_base_price unless expected_differences lists it with the price we give and why.",
        "Kuta 1 receipts all went through Receipt_other_purchases.php (receipts without a purchase order), whose formula subtracts Harga_Beli x Diskon_1 / 100 after the tax term. It equals Goods_receipt.php on every Kuta 1 line without a discount; the two with a discount are expected differences.",
        "A chain is every receipt line of one Kuta 1 item in date order. Replayed from base price 0 with the raise-only rule (a receipt raises the base price to its own price when higher, never lowers it), the last base price must equal the item's legacy Harga_Jual today, unless the chain names our_base_price and its reason."
    ],
    "case_columns": [
        "unit_cost",
        "vat_percent",
        "conversion",
        "discount_percent",
        "legacy_base_price"
    ],
